go 1.26

toolchain go1.26.6

// Deliberately a single-module workspace, mirroring gzh-cli-quality (605ea39).
// It is tracked to stop `go` from walking up into the devbox checkout's own
// go.work, which lists multiple sibling modules — not to wire the siblings in
// here. Naming absent siblings is what broke this: outside a devbox layout
// there are no siblings, so every `go` invocation failed before it started, on
// CI and in any fresh clone alike. Cross-repo local development goes through
// `make local-dev` in the devbox, which is the documented mechanism.
use .
